@startuml
title SEQ-10 - Data Export and Idempotent Capture Import
autonumber
actor User
boundary Web
control GotIt
control Core
database DB as "product_gotit"

alt Export
  User -> Web: Export library
  loop Until nextCursor is null
    Web -> GotIt: GET /export?cursor&limit
    GotIt -> Core: Authenticate
    GotIt -> DB: Read owned current non-deleted items\ntranslations/skills/tags/progress
    GotIt --> Web: learning_library_v1 page + nextCursor
  end
  Web -> Web: Validate/assemble versioned JSON
  Web --> User: Download file
else Import
  User -> Web: Select JSON file
  Web -> Web: Enforce size and parse capture_requests_v1
  break Invalid format/file
    Web --> User: Local validation error
  end
  Web -> GotIt: POST /import\n1..100 eventId+capture entries
  GotIt -> Core: Authenticate + vocabulary.write
  loop Each entry within total deadline
    GotIt -> GotIt: Invoke capture save with entry.eventId
    GotIt -> DB: Create/replay idempotent capture receipt
    alt Success
      GotIt -> GotIt: Add succeeded result
    else Entry-specific failure
      GotIt -> GotIt: Add safe error code and continue
    end
  end
  GotIt --> Web: 200 all succeeded / 207 partial results
  Web --> User: Per-entry results + retry failed only
end
note over Web,GotIt
Import does not accept client-provided attempts, mastery, scores or XP.
end note
@enduml

